{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13595","headline":"军城早秋 · 严武","name":"军城早秋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨夜秋风入汉关，朔云边月满西山。\n更催飞将追骄虏，莫遣沙场匹马远。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严武","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「军城早秋」条，撰者郭扬波、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"郭扬波"}